---
const heroImage = "/images/mylo-hero.png";
---

<section
  id="meet-mylo"
  class="border-b border-border py-14 sm:py-16"
  aria-labelledby="meet-mylo-heading"
>
  <div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-6xl gap-10 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center lg:px-8">
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-primary">Meet Mylo</p>
      <h2
        id="meet-mylo-heading"
        class="font-display mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] sm:text-3xl"
      >
        Your lab&apos;s research scout—not wallpaper
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-[var(--text-secondary)]">
        Mylo guides discovery, surfaces grant and fellowship matches, and explains
        what changed in your evidence graph. He shows up where the product is
        acting like a guide: alerts, onboarding, empty states, and strategic nudges.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--text-secondary)]">
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="mt-1 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Literature scans with clear source links for human review.
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="mt-1 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Opportunity alerts that name fit, deadlines, and uncertainty.
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="mt-1 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Gentle prompts that respect reduced-motion and serious lab workflows.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <a
        class="mt-8 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full border border-border bg-card px-6 text-sm font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)] transition hover:bg-secondary"
        href="/about"
      >
        Learn about Mylo and the mission
      </a>
    </div>

    <figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border bg-card shadow-sm">
      <img
        src={heroImage}
        alt=""
        class="h-full max-h-80 w-full object-cover object-center opacity-95"
        width="1672"
        height="941"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <figcaption class="border-t border-border px-5 py-4 text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)]">
        Mylo connects papers, people, projects, and funding signals—always with room
        for your team to approve what ships.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
